Select one of the regular expressions listed below. Plant Simulation then enters it into the text box Find
What. Compare the examples under regex_search.
Select To enter and to find
Any single character .
Beginning of line ^
End of line $
Beginning of word \<
End of word \>
Group \(\)
Zero or one matches ?
Zero or more matches *
One or more matches +
Any one character in the set [ ]
Any one character not in the set [^]
Or \|
Plant Simulation only finds a search term with a regular expression if you select the check box Regular
Expression 
