if-else
Inserts an if-else-statement at the position of the cursor into the source code of your Method.
Remarks
Type in the condition of the if-statement. Press the Tab key to jump to the location within the source code,
at which you can type in the statement that is to be executed, when the condition becomes true.
You can also highlight several statements before you select the command if-else. Then Plant Simulation
inserts an if-statement around these statements in the source code.
Note
Drag the mouse over the sections marked in red to show a Tooltip.
See also
Branching with if-else-end
Multiple Branching with if-elseif-end
