Inherit Source Code
Turns inheritance of the source code of a Method object which you insert into a Frame off or on.
Remarks
As long as it is turned on, you cannot modify the source code that tells Plant Simulation what to do; the
Method then uses the source code of the Method from which it is derived, i.e., its origin.
Click Inherit Source Code to turn it off and thus be able to edit the source code in an open Method.
