Debug Method [button]
Runs the Method, i.e., executes the source code one step at a time in the Debugger.
Remarks
Plant Simulation opens the Method Debugger where you can step through the source code using the
Step Into or Step Over commands/buttons. The command Debug does the same as running the Method
while holding down the Ctrl+Alt+Shift keys.
• If Plant Simulation is stuck in an endless loop and if Plant Simulation is running in the foreground, hold
down the Ctrl+Alt+Shift left keys for 5 seconds to open the Method Debugger while a Method is being
executed.
• If Plant Simulation is stuck in an endless loop and if Plant Simulation is not running in the foreground,
hold down the Ctrl+Alt+Shift right keys for 5 seconds to open the Method Debugger while a Method is
being executed.
