Toggle Bookmarks
Adds a bookmark for the current row or the currently selected range of the source code. Plant Simulation
highlights the bookmark in the bar to the left. Bookmarks facilitate navigation in source code that extends
over many lines.
Remarks
Plant Simulation marks temporary bookmarks in the source code of a Method in a brighter color than
saved bookmarks 
 . This might, for example, be the case if you changed the source code of a Method and
set a bookmark after the original end of the source code. Temporary bookmarks will be lost if you do not
apply the source code.
