Encrypt Method
Encrypts the source code of the selected Method. This prevents unauthorized access by other users if you
pass the model on to colleagues or customers.
Remarks
Type in the password for encrypting the Method into the text box Password.
Type in the password for encrypting the Method again into the text box Confirm Password.
Make sure to remember the password, as only this password will allow you to decrypt the source code
afterward. After clicking OK, the source code cannot be accessed anymore without the password you
typed in.
After you have encrypted the Method, the command Encrypt changes to Decrypt. In addition, you can
encrypt all Methods in the entire model, except for Methods in the Class Library, by selecting File >
Options > Encrypt Methods in the Plant Simulation main window.
SimTalk
encrypt [SimTalk]
decrypt [SimTalk]
