Decrypt Method
Decrypts the encrypted source code of the selected Method.
Remarks
Type the correct password you used to encrypt the Method into the text box Password. In addition, you
can decrypt the entire model by selecting File > Options > Decrypt Methods in the Plant Simulation main
window.
